# Rasaoi Backend Rules

Read `supabase/CURSOR.md` and `.cursor/CONTEXT_PLAN.md` before editing.

## Conventions

- Edge functions use Deno + `_shared/ai-client.ts` for Gemini
- All 5 functions deployed with `--no-verify-jwt`
- File-level `//` purpose comments on every edge function

## Migrations

- **Add-only** — never edit applied migration files
- New schema changes → new file in `supabase/migrations/`
- After migration → regenerate `src/integrations/supabase/types.ts`

## Required Sync on Change

- `_shared/dietary.ts` → also update `src/lib/dietary.ts`
- `parse-intent` prompt changes → verify client scoring alignment in `veda.ts`, `pairings.ts`
- Mock fixtures → sync `src/testing/mock-places.json`

## Deploy

`npm run supabase:deploy:all` — secrets set via `npx supabase secrets set`, never committed
